<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Hello world</mj-title>
    <mj-font name="Roboto" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,500"></mj-font>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif"></mj-all>
      <mj-text font-weight="300" font-size="16px" color="#616161" line-height="24px"></mj-text>
      <mj-section padding="0px"></mj-section>
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column width="30%">
        <mj-image src="https://www.simrishamn.se/images/18.17f76b1d185fe62c44b8e9db/1676445792061/simrishamn-logo-kvadratisk.svg"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="20px 0">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text align="center" font-weight="500" padding="0px" font-size="18px">Kvitto på inskickat formulär</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column width="70%">
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#616161"></mj-divider>
        <mj-text align="center" font-weight="500" padding="0px" font-size="18px">Formulär ID - ##formcreator.request_id##</mj-text>
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#616161"></mj-divider>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="10px 0">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text align="center">
          <p>Tack för att du hör av dig till oss!</p>
          <p>Vi har tagit emot ditt inskickade formulär</p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="20px" font-weight="500" padding="0px">
          <p style="font-style: italic">"##formcreator.form_name##"</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="20px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text>
          <p style="font-weight: 500">Vad händer nu?</p>
          <p>Ditt inskickade formulär kommer att tas om hand av en handläggare som återkommer till dig om det behövs.</p>
          <p>Om du vill titta på ditt inskickade formulär kan du <a href="##formcreator.validation_link##" style="color: #3498db">klicka här för att se formuläret i helpdesken</a>.</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text padding="0 25px">
          <p style="color: #bdbdbd; line-height: 9px">Vänligen - <a href="https://glpi.simrishamn.int" style="color: #3498db"> Helpdesken </a></p>
          <p style="font-style: italic; color: #bdbdbd; line-height: 9px">Simrishamns kommun</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
